sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as Checkout worker
    participant S as Shop DB
    participant R as Sweeper
    participant P as Payment provider
    W->>S: COMMIT co_7f3a pending, stock reserved
    W-)P: POST /charges key=co_7f3a
    Note over W,P: request held in flight
    Note over R: t = 2 s, co_7f3a is stale
    R->>P: GET /charges?key=co_7f3a
    P-->>R: 404 — nothing recorded yet
    R->>S: state = failed, stock released
    Note over P: t = 4 s, the request arrives
    P->>P: charge recorded
    P-->>W: 200 succeeded
    W->>S: UPDATE ... WHERE state = 'pending' — 0 rows
    Note over S,P: charged, checkout failed, no order
